// Labelling convention, applied to every row below.
// confirm  plainly authorises THIS payment now.
// decline  does not want this payment made.
// modify   wants a different amount; modified_amount_cents carries it.
// unclear  anything else, including a hedged or conditional yes, a reply
//          that agrees to something other than this proposal, a question,
//          a typo that cannot be read with confidence, and off topic text.
// A conditional yes is never confirm. "yes but next week" is unclear because
// it agrees in principle and not to this payment now; "not right now" is a
// decline because it refuses it outright.
